    "detailed_description": "This horror game inspired by Chinese folklore offers an enthralling journey through the depths of the Underworld. As you delve deeper, you'll unravel hidden secrets veiled in the darkness.<br><br><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br>In a realm shrouded in dread, you'll traverse eerie landscapes, encounter various ghosts, and immerse yourself in their stories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Heart-Pounding Survival</strong><br>Surviving in this underworld demands courage and cunning, as danger lurks around every corner. Search for food, build shelters, and craft your own weapons to stay alive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dungeons &amp; Gameplay</strong><br>Some ghosts must be vanquished, while others avoided. Utilize the environment and resources, and cooperate with other players to enhance your chances of survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gripping Narrative</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping storyline populated by unique ghosts. Confront your deepest fears and uncover the stories behind the ghosts as you navigate the Underworld.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dynamic Multiplayer</strong><br>Play in an online multiplayer mode and invite friends to embark on this adventure together!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/52df5bef7bee722de5d3f52b8c8b2838.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/52df5bef7bee722de5d3f52b8c8b2838.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/52df5bef7bee722de5d3f52b8c8b2838.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "This horror game inspired by Chinese folklore offers an enthralling journey through the depths of the Underworld. As you delve deeper, you'll unravel hidden secrets veiled in the darkness.<br><br><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br>In a realm shrouded in dread, you'll traverse eerie landscapes, encounter various ghosts, and immerse yourself in their stories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/e9b9f77b62e3f8e8fc1cd1752508f6b2.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Heart-Pounding Survival</strong><br>Surviving in this underworld demands courage and cunning, as danger lurks around every corner. Search for food, build shelters, and craft your own weapons to stay alive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/3bba9c8fa93a74fab279b37baf457de4.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dungeons &amp; Gameplay</strong><br>Some ghosts must be vanquished, while others avoided. Utilize the environment and resources, and cooperate with other players to enhance your chances of survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b5bc7742a3a3a61689da6b35f5f9c10f.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gripping Narrative</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping storyline populated by unique ghosts. Confront your deepest fears and uncover the stories behind the ghosts as you navigate the Underworld.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/b8e3b9ea3ac179d6012aa8e61607e666.mp4?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dynamic Multiplayer</strong><br>Play in an online multiplayer mode and invite friends to embark on this adventure together!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/52df5bef7bee722de5d3f52b8c8b2838.poster.avif?t=1730286993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455040/extras/52df5bef7bee722de5d3f52b8c8b2838.webm?t=1730286993\" type=\"video/webm; codec